# {{project-name}}

## Run

Run tests:
```sh
cargo test
```

Run via cargo:
```sh
cargo run
```

Build and run executable in release mode
```sh
cargo build --release
./target/release/{{project-name}}
```

Run formatter:
```
cargo fmt
```
Use
```
cargo fmt -- --check
```
to check formatting without changing files.

Run linter:
```
cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings
```
